## Goal
Build the analytics dashboard. This is the centrepiece of the portfolio 
story — real behavioral data from actual usage visualized with Recharts.
Everything shown is powered by real data flowing into Supabase from 
Steps 2 and 3.

## Scope — Do NOT go beyond this
- No Cohere AI yet (Step 5)
- No new Supabase tables — read from search_events, asset_views, 
  watchlist only
- No auth, no login, no user accounts — ever

## Do Not
- Break existing stock grid, detail page, or watchlist
- Use any charting library other than Recharts
- Use any HTTP library — native fetch only
- Change any existing colors or styles
- Commit broken or incomplete code
- Touch dev or main branch

