## Task 3 — Analytics dashboard page
Create app/analytics/page.tsx as a client component ('use client').

Page background: #0a0f1e
All section cards: dark navy background consistent with existing app

Layout: responsive grid, 2 columns on desktop, 1 on mobile.

Section 1 — Search Activity Last 30 Days (full width):
- Recharts AreaChart
- X axis: date, Y axis: search count
- Stroke: #3b82f6 (blue), fill with low opacity
- Title: "Search Activity — Last 30 Days"

Section 2 — Most Searched Tickers (left column):
- Recharts BarChart layout="vertical"
- X axis: count, Y axis: query term
- Bar color: #3b82f6
- Title: "Most Searched"

Section 3 — Most Viewed Stocks (right column):
- Recharts BarChart
- X axis: ticker, Y axis: view count
- Bar color: #10b981 (emerald)
- Title: "Most Viewed"

Section 4 — Trending This Week (left column):
- Ranked list, no chart needed
- Numbered 1-10, query term, count badge
- Title: "Trending This Week"

Section 5 — My Portfolio Stats (right column):
- Recharts PieChart donut style
- Three segments: Watchlist / Researching / Invested
- Colors: #3b82f6, #f59e0b, #10b981
- Show total count in center
- Title: "My Portfolio"

All charts:
- Wrap in ResponsiveContainer width="100%" height={300}
- Tooltip background: #1e293b, border: #334155
- Axis labels: #9ca3af
- Loading: show skeleton placeholder per section
- Error/empty: show "No data yet" message — never crash

